  "en": {
   "name": "The lake Jasna",
   "subtitle": "Kranjska Gora",
   "description": "This district consists of two connected reservoirs that were made by taking away the gravel from the confluence of the creeks Velika and Mala Pišnica. An additional supplement to fishing can be the extremely picturesque nature and the view to the Julijske Alpe mountains as well as the pebbled surroundings of the lake itself. In the most parts of the pretty cold water you can catch brown, rainbow or brook trouts."
