   "description": "This district offers the strongest possibility of trophy catch. It is possible to fish even using a belly boat (without any kind of motorized propulsion) up to the sign for the power plant approximately 100 m before the lower barrier. The possibility of fishing from the shore largely depends on water levels - they can cover all the access points during the rain season."
