   "description": "It is the most pictureque area in fish life in the RD Jesenice. The district begins in the pools under the hydropower plant Moste and concludes just before the confluence of the Sava Dolinka and the Sava Bohinjka in Radovljica. The route of this water basin runs through the unspoilt nature in the valley Piškovce, through rapids in Berje and Lisice and through the famous camp Šobec in Lesce."
